# 42. DATA WAREHOUSE / ANALYTICS LAYER

Do not run all heavy analytics against transactional tables.

Design an analytics architecture.

Possible approach:

Transactional PostgreSQL

↓

ETL/ELT

↓

Analytics tables / materialized views

↓

Analytics service

↓

Dashboards / AI

Use the simplest architecture that fits the current application.

Do not introduce unnecessary infrastructure.

