# 47. AI MODEL ABSTRACTION

Do not hard-code a single LLM provider.

Create:

AIProvider

with implementations such as:

* Local model
* Cloud LLM
* Future providers

Example abstraction:

AIProvider.generate()

AIProvider.embed()

AIProvider.classify()

AIProvider.summarize()

Do not make the entire application dependent on one AI vendor.

