# 51. PROMPT INJECTION DEFENSE

Implement protection against prompt injection.

AI must not blindly follow instructions found in:

* Employee profiles
* Documents
* Uploaded files
* Job descriptions
* Notes
* Comments
* Emails
* Policies

Treat external/user-generated text as untrusted data.

