# 60. MULTI-TENANT AI ISOLATION

This is mandatory.

AI context must never mix:

Tenant A

with

Tenant B.

Conversation history must be tenant-scoped.

Analytics cache must be tenant-scoped.

Embeddings/vector data must be tenant-scoped.

AI audit logs must be tenant-scoped.

---

# 61. VECTOR / EMBEDDING ARCHITECTURE

Only introduce vector search if genuinely useful.

Potential use cases:

* HR policy search
* Document search
* Internal HR knowledge
* Company handbook Q&A

If vector storage is implemented:

* Tenant isolation
* Document-level authorization
* Metadata filtering
* Permission filtering
* Deletion support
* Re-indexing
* Versioning

must be implemented.

Never retrieve a document through vector search if the user is not authorized to access it.

