Transformation

Calculation version

Generated timestamp

This helps explain:

"Where did this number come from?"

---

# 79. ANALYTICS VERSIONING

Metrics must be versioned where formulas can change.

Example:

Attrition Formula v1

Attrition Formula v2

Historical reports should retain calculation consistency.

