# 100. TENANT ISOLATION TESTS

Mandatory scenarios:

Tenant A asks AI about Tenant B.

Tenant A requests Tenant B analytics.

Tenant A requests Tenant B dashboard.

Tenant A accesses Tenant B anomaly.

Tenant A accesses Tenant B forecast.

Tenant A accesses Tenant B AI conversation.

All must fail.

---

# 101. RBAC TESTS

Test:

Employee

Manager

HR

Payroll

Compliance

Administrator

Super Administrator

Each role must only access permitted analytics.

