# 120. DO NOT DO THESE THINGS

Do NOT:

* Give an LLM direct production DB access
* Execute raw AI-generated SQL
* Bypass RBAC
* Bypass tenant isolation
* Mix tenant AI contexts
* Expose private employee information
* Automatically make employment decisions
* Automatically terminate employees
* Automatically reject candidates
* Automatically reject leave
* Automatically change payroll
* Automatically modify salary
* Treat predictions as facts
* Train external models on employee data by default
* Store secrets in source code
* Log sensitive HR information unnecessarily
* Allow unrestricted analytics queries
* Build duplicate existing modules
* Over-engineer infrastructure unnecessarily

